THM-4223 exact audit transcript
================================

Status separation
-----------------
PROVED: the Boolean cut-cover hierarchy and the formulas for H, End_i,
N_ij, D_i, q, B_ij, and the endpoint multigraph degrees.
REFUTED: B_ij <= End_i End_j for all strong tournaments.
FINITE-EXACT / OPEN: B_ij <= End_i End_j + min(End_i,End_j) survives the
complete strong-class census through order nine; no all-order proof is
claimed.

Environment
-----------
Apple clang version 17.0.0 (clang-1700.0.13.5)
Target: arm64-apple-darwin24.3.0
Homebrew nauty 2.9.3:
  /opt/homebrew/bin/gentourng -> ../Cellar/nauty/2.9.3/bin/gentourng

Build
-----
clang++ -std=c++17 -O3 -Wall -Wextra -pedantic \
  04-computation/tournament_cyclic_cut_cover_boolean_mobius_thm4223.cpp \
  -o /tmp/tournament-cut-cover-thm4223-O3

Direct order-nine witness
-------------------------
Command:
  /tmp/tournament-cut-cover-thm4223-O3 --direct-witness

Output:
mode=direct_witness
encoding=upper_triangle_row_major;1_means_i_to_j
word=110111111111111111111111011111111110
order=9 strong=yes cyclic_orders=40320
H=85 c=1
End=(1,1,2,1,5,10,20,5,40)
A=(0,0,1,0,4,9,19,4,39)
D=(0,17,84,50,219,387,655,420,1082)
outdegree=(7,7,6,5,4,3,2,1,1)
pair=6,7 N=128 B=104 End_product=100 product_plus_min=105
pair=7,8 N=249 B=205 End_product=200 product_plus_min=205
checks=PASS permutation_vs_DP,all_exact_formulas,boolean_mobius_512_subsets

The direct mode literally scans all 9! linear vertex orders. Fixing vertex
zero first gives the 8!=40320 cyclic orders modulo rotation. Independently,
subset Hamilton-path DP reconstructs H, End, D, c, and the two-path-cover
counts. The mode also forms the complete 512-entry Boolean zeta transform
and inverts it back to every exact bad-owner count C_S.

